{{Skill infobox|id=AspectOfTheCrab}}

'''Aspect of the Crab''' is an [[aspect]] skill that generates a Crab Barrier every 0.5 seconds, granting [[physical damage reduction]] for each Crab Barrier the player has. All Crab Barriers are lost when the player takes physical damage from a hit. Only one aspect skill can be active at a time. The rate of Crab Barrier gain is unrelated to the skill's [[cooldown]].<ref>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9NBPrFq5Y5g</ref> 

Aspect of the Crab is found on {{il|Craiceann's Carapace}} or [[beastcrafted]] onto gear as a [[Item affix|suffix]] ({{ml|GrantsCrabAspectCrafted}}) using the captured "[[Craiceann, First of the Deep]]" unique beast. The skill can be further modified by equipping {{il|Craiceann's Tracks}}, {{il|Craiceann's Pincers}} and/or {{il|Craiceann's Chitin}}. The Level 30 version of the skill is acquired from beastcrafting with the addition of [[The Black Mórrígan]].

